hose vaccination programs  start to take effect  the only other option if overburdened  health systems are to cope  is to impose ever more lockdown  restrictions  but with people tired angry and defiant  those measures are proving to be  increasingly  ineffective daniel schweiner al jazeera  buenos aires
 

